{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36636","headline":"钱尚父生日 · 罗隐","name":"钱尚父生日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大昴分光降斗牛，兴唐宗社作诸侯。\n伊夔事业扶千载，韩白机谋冠九州。\n贵盛上持龙节钺，延长应续鹤春秋。\n锦衣玉食将何报，更俟庄椿一举头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}